    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bennetts Auctioneers are delighted to bring Apt 2 Oaklands Court to the market. This spacious two-bedroom, two bathroom apartment enjoys an enviable location within this highly sought-after development, ideally nestled between the vibrant villages of Sandymount and Ballsbridge. Extending to approximately 70 sq. m. the property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout. Features of the property include gas fired central heating, car parking space and a large bright living area. The bright and spacious accommodation of c. 70 sq. m. briefly consists of entrance hallway, living room, kitchen, two double bedrooms, two bathrooms and a good-sized storage room.\r\n\r\nExternally there is car parking space behind secure electronic gates.\r\n\r\nViewing highly advised.\r\n\r\n\r\nLOCATION\r\n\r\nIdeally situated off Serpentine Avenue, No. 2 could not benefit from a more convenient location with a host of amenities including excellent shops, supermarket, boutiques, cafes and numerous excellent eateries, along with pleasant promenade walks along Sandymount Strand. The Aviva Stadium and R.D.S are a few minutes’ walk away as are the villages of Ballsbridge and Sandymount. The area is well served by public transport with numerous bus routes close by and both Sandymount and Lansdowne Dart stations a short stroll away. The IFSC, Silicon Docks and City Centre are a short car journey away as is the East Link Bridge giving easy access to the Port Tunnel and Dublin Airport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall:  1.25m x 3.20m  wood flooring, intercom, hot press  \r\n\r\nKitchen:  3.70m x 2.10m  tiled flooring, tiled splashback, range of floor and eye level units, gas oven with extractor fan, integrated fridge freezer, stainless steel sink, fully plumbed for washer dryer  \r\n\r\nLiving room:  4.35m x 4.75m  carpet flooring, coving, feature gas fireplace, dual windows  \r\n\r\nBedroom 1:  3.00m x 3.65m  carpet flooring, coving, built in wardrobes, window to garden  \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:  3.00m x 3.55m  carpet flooring, coving, built in wardrobes, window to garden  \r\n\r\nBathroom:  2.20m x 1.70m  tiled flooring, coving, bath unit with electric shower, W.H.B., W.C.\r\n\r\nW.C:  1.00m x 1.30m  tiled flooring, W.H.B., W.C.  \r\n\r\nStore Room:  1.95m x 1.50m  wood flooring\r\n\r\nTotal floor area: c. 70 sq. m. \r\n\r\nService Charge : €3,000.00 per Annum"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Bright and exceptionally spacious two bedroom apartment\r\n\r\nPrime location between Claremont Road and Serpentine Avenue\r\n\r\nGas fired central heating & double glazed windows throughout\r\n\r\nAdjacent to Sandymount Village, R.D.S & Aviva Stadium\r\n\r\nResidential parking behind secure electronic gates\r\n\r\nTotal Floor Area  c. 70 sq. m."
      },
